      "body": "## What\n\nRe-applies the unique remainder of closed archive PR #7529 — `pkgs/id/tests/probe_policy_reply.rs` (168 lines, nothing else) — onto current `main`.\n\nPR #7529 was bulk-closed unmerged by the 2026-11-08 archive sweep. Per task 14207 the closed PR is the preservation record and diff source; the deleted archive branch is not recreated.\n\n## Why it is still current\n\nThe probe's API surface still exists on `main` at this branch point:\n\n- `id::world_net::{WorldClient, WORLD_ALPN}`, `WorldClient::connect`, `set_cross_world_write`, `force_cross_world_write`, `set_file_scope`, `manifest_state`, `close` (`pkgs/id/src/world_net.rs:1080,1246,1265,1282,2278`)\n- `id::frames::{read_frame, write_frame}`\n- the iroh `presets::Minimal` / `RelayMode::Disabled` / `Router` / `EndpointAddr::from_parts(bound_sockets)` pattern used by `pkgs/id/tests/worlds_default_validation.rs`\n\n## What the test covers\n\nScripted host replies against `WorldClient`:\n\n- control: a well-formed `policy` reply returns its policy;\n- a `policy` reply missing `policy`, or carrying a number/string there, must Err rather than return `Ok(null)`/`Ok(verbatim)`;\n- control: numeric `seed` reads back, absent `seed` is the legitimate capability-only `None`;\n- mistyped `seed` (string, negative, float, object) must Err;\n- oracle: the sibling `schedules` field in the same reply is already validated (mistyping it Errs), so `seed` should be held to the same standard.\n\nProbe cases print their result; the control and oracle cases assert.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test --test probe_policy_reply` (in `pkgs/id`) — see checks below.\n- No production code changed.\n\nCloses nothing by design: this is the salvage remainder for #7297.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796820552&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8047&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8047&signature=4922025c49ebd64ee1a3504d4dac3d26e598eb09cbb40fa924b09805c8496e8a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8047?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
