      "body": "Fixes #4871 (queue task 7529).\n\n## What\n\n`create_pairing_code` in `pkgs/id/src/hosted_binding.rs` now supersedes every previously minted, unexchanged pairing code for the same challenge before minting the new one (`pairing_codes.retain(...)` after rate-limit accounting, before code generation):\n\n- At most one live pairing code per ceremony — \"that code went to the wrong place, give me a new one\" now actually revokes the old code.\n- Supersede is per-`challenge_id`: codes for other challenges are untouched.\n- A rate-limited mint returns `RateLimited` before any supersede, so a failed mint never revokes a live code.\n- Docs on `create_pairing_code` and `PairingCode` state the one-live-code contract.\n\n## Test\n\nNew regression test `minting_a_pairing_code_supersedes_earlier_codes_for_the_challenge`: code A minted, code B minted for the same challenge → exchanging A fails with `UnknownChallenge`, exchanging B succeeds and returns the challenge, B is still single-use, and a code for a different challenge still exchanges.\n\nVerified on the laptop worktree: `cargo test -p id --lib hosted_binding` — 22 passed, 0 failed (including the new test and the preserved expiry/rate-limit test `pairing_codes_expire_with_the_challenge_and_rate_limit`).\n\nAcceptance mapping: supersede behaviour ✅ · regression test (A fails / B succeeds) ✅ · single-code single-use + rate limit + expiry preserved (existing tests pass) ✅ · no production behaviour change beyond the pairing-code invalidation ✅\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796345046&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=5223&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F5223&signature=48527d12e63c3a36287edb7040107c9b5e2c7c968dd05ae22de6af85338436e1\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/5223?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
